                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had a good few hours of fun playing Kittypocalypse - Ungoogled. The first few levels are easy, the middle couple of levels get tough, but the last levels are easy since most of the weaponsa are unlocked by that time. Nothing too complicated, just the right dose of hectic action and management. \n\nThe only thing that's REALLY bothering me is that some of the achievements are bugged! As a completionist, this is annoying as hell. Hopefully the devs will iron this out! I can't wait to stream this game once it's fixed!\n\nA few other thoughts:\n1) There is a lot of potential for Kitty humor in this game. Maybe hire a writer to work in some jokes - or ask the community for a few one-liners. \n2) Modding - it would be awesome if users could make their own maps\n3) Have a few more voice over options like 'new wave arriving'",
                        "timestamp_created": 1478440200,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1478440200,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 25,
                        "votes_funny": 1,
